<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Bata pays 10 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Bata pays 10 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees).</p>
<p>    Sales			   2,001 vs 1,813</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		49 vs    45</p>
<p>    Profit after tax		 29 vs    26</p>
<p>    Dividend		     10 pct vs    10 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Bata Pakistan Limited. The company has announced a 10 percent dividend. AGM on April 9 at Batapur. Book closure April 3 to 9.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
